{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "%@へようこそ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welcome to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10文字以内で入力して下さい" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter up to 10 characters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appleアカウントで、すぐに始められます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get started right away with your Apple Account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "homeauは無料のままでもすべての家事管理機能をお使いいただけます。\nもっと快適に使いたい方向けに、プレミアムプランをご用意しています。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every chore management feature in homeau is free to use.\nFor an even better experience, we also offer a Premium Plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと%lld文字" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld character left"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld characters left"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あとで決める" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maybe Later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この名前はパートナーの画面でも表示されます。\n後からいつでも変更可能です。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This name will also appear on your partner's screen.\nYou can change it anytime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめまして！" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nice to meet you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まずはあなたのニックネームを教えてください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First, tell us your nickname"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウント登録" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ダッシュボードのバナー広告が消え、家事の記録に集中できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Banner ads are removed from the Dashboard, so you can focus on your chores."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プランを見る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "View Plans"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プレミアムプランのご案内" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Introducing Premium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プレミアム限定の新機能が増えても、追加の料金はかかりません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New Premium-only features come at no extra cost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ユーザー名" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Username"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今後追加される機能もすべて使えます" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get every feature we add in the future"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例：たろう" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "e.g. Alex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
